{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"comes back in \"What can i get for you?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:09:50.062000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745041727584469122","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“Just a mead, and maybe a conversation.” They smile.","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:10:18.336000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745041846174220328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"pulls out a bottle of golden liquid, and pours two drinks.  Sets one in front of Wynne \"how would you start said conversation?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:11:34.436000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745042165360754708","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"They take a sip. “I’d ask how you’ve been doing. A lot has happened since the sub.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:12:06.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745042298487832616","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"A smile grows on Hekis always morphing face \"Why, thank you.  Most people wait for me to ask that question.  Today, I would say I am doing as well as can be expected.  Seen many people accept their heroic fates, and I hope to have some new stories to write soon.  How have you been?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:13:43.527000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745042706807521340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“Busy, to be sure. Especially now that I’ve got a baby on the way. By the way, are you any good at picking names?”","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:15:08.092000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745043061498970272","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Ah, one of the most important questions a family can have.  You know they say a name dictates the person they grow to be.  So, if you were to choose, who would your child grow into being?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:16:55.240000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745043510910124202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“As long as she’s happy, I don’t care. She can be however she wants to be.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:17:42.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745043708147400834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Of course, but for instance, If you named your child Solomon, it would evoke images of dread and damnation, thus people will treat the child that way, and thats who they will be.  A name is the most important thing a parent gives a child.  So you want something happy, free, and feminine, since you said she?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:20:39.794000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745044452757995631","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“We know she will be a girl. Feminine isn’t a requirement, though. We were thinking natural  names, like River.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:22:26.901000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745044901997052008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"How about Blythe?  It literally means happy, and sounds mysterious, and heroic.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:23:32.124000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745045175562272840","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"They write it down in their journal. You can see the page they’re writing on is full of names. They drink a bit more mead.","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:26:02.960000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745045808214442134","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
