{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"(🤭😊😊😊)","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:28:56.099000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745046534411911249","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"What other names are you looking at?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:29:48.184000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745046752872104016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“Fern, Brooke, Astra, Jade...” they shrug. “I’m terrible at names.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:33:38.154000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745047717436456960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I dated a girl named Fern once, she had the personality of her namesake.  Jade though, calling your child a beautiful rare stone.  I could see that as an agreeable name.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:35:17.616000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745048134610321528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"They nod and cross out Fern. “Thank you.” Their brow furrows for a moment. “Where have you been living, if I may ask. This pub certainly isn’t habitable.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:38:09.413000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745048855178903572","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Up until the other day, with all the crew.  But the cornerstone of our town was laying amongst the rubble of this pub, so it is my home.  I quit the crew to become a bartender, and gather some stories.  You dont need solid walls, or a ceiling overhead to find yourself at home.  Just put some love into the place, and feel a peace\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:41:25.641000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745049678218920006","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"XD","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:42:39.540000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745049988173922395","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"They smile. “Very poetic. But honestly, if you need a place to sleep that will keep you safe from the elements, I have an extra room that you could use.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:43:18.069000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745050149775999096","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Appreciated, but not necessary.  If you drink enough, you wont wake from some rain.  But I will keep it in mind if i need a place to hide from the lads and lasses that might chase me\" he says with a grin that makes it obvious the last line is a joke.","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:45:34.199000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745050720746602527","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"They laugh and finish their mead. “You’re certainly a fun person to talk to.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:46:28.815000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-17T22:48:47.248000Z","id":"745050949822840923","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
