{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“It certainly is.” They give him another smile. “I’ve missed out on your company until now. I know better now.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:49:25.583000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745051691241570398","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"laughs \"I think many people are discovering this pub is the place to be if you want a *good time*\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:50:02.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745051845193629696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"They nod and get up out of their seat. “I have to head back home, but thank you for the drink and the conversation.” They set a small bag of 25gp on the table. “I’ll definitely be back to see you, my friend.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T22:54:23.957000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745052942712700928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
