{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"One lump or two? Lemon?\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T08:47:13.885000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745564521669591042","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Leaf nods and watches him prepare the tea. \"And it's all so strange... The difference between 3 days and,\" Leaf pauses, saying it out loud for the first time, \"*hundreds* of years-\" she looks at the tea and blinks, processing his question. \"Oh uh, just one is fine thanks.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T08:48:43.233000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745564896422395986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Time isnt just a line lass. Take this for example.\" He points to the abacus. \"This is a tool for telling how much good or bad happens in the world when some one dies.  And how to help fix it when something goes wrong. Time isn't just this straight line that gets us from place to place. From one day to the next. No matter where or when you are its what you do that matters. How you represent them what you left behind either in time or in death. \"","created_at":"2020-08-19T08:53:50.885000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745566186808541276","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Leaf nods slowly, thinking what he said over. \"I've just never had so little time and so much time to consider all at once. But you're right. It's what we do that matters.\" She takes her holy symbol and looks it over \"And I suppose that won't change much either way.\"","created_at":"2020-08-19T09:01:02.206000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745567995899805728","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
